  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "JznFaASsmAZicpdJnq8lTLFuHUI=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:36:01.032Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The manual generator flag was renamed between v6.0.0 and v6.2.2, and the short-flag reassignment is the dangerous half.\n\n**v6.0.0** (`packages/@powerhousedao/ph-cli/dist/cli.mjs`):\n\n```\nfile:  long \"file\",  short \"f\"   \u2014 path to the file to generate from\ndir:   long \"dir\",   short \"d\"   \u2014 existing document model directory to re-generate\nall:   long \"all\",   short \"a\"\n```\n\n**v6.2.2-dev.45**:\n\n```\ndocument: long \"document\", short \"d\"  \u2014 path to a .phd or .json spec\ndir:      long \"dir\"                  \u2014 (no short form any more)\nall:      long \"all\",      short \"a\"\nextract:  long \"extract\",  short \"x\"\n```\n\nSo `-d` moved from `--dir` to `--document`. A v6.0-era script or muscle-memory invocation of `ph generate document-model -d document-models/todo` used to mean \"re-generate this existing directory\" and now means \"treat this path as a spec file\" \u2014 a different operation on the same argument, with no deprecation warning. Prefer the long forms in anything scripted.\n\nTwo further changes: `--document` accepts `.json` as well as `.phd` (the handler branches on the `.phd` extension and falls through to `loadDocumentModel` otherwise), and `--extract` is new \u2014 it writes a `powerhouse/document-model` spec for each existing model into `specs/document-models/` instead of generating code. The command also has the alias `doc`. Supplying none of `document`, `dir`, `all`, or `extract` is not an error; it prints `Please specify one of ...` and exits.\n\nManual generation is only needed for the Connect export workflow. Under `ph vetra`, codegen runs automatically from the spec documents on the Vetra drive.\n\n_Source: @powerhousedao/ph-cli dist/cli.mjs and dist/generate-document-model-*.mjs, compared across v6.0.0 and v6.2.2-dev.45. The academy's 08-DocumentModelVersioning.md still shows the flagless `ph generate TodoList.phd` form, which is dead._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:36:00.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:36:01.032Z"
    }
  },
